Short:        Asm lang include file optimizer.
Author:       cee@voyager.co.nz (Cliff Earl)
Uploader:     cee voyager co nz (Cliff Earl)
Type:         dev/asm
Version:      V2.0
Replaces:     dev/asm/AStripI*
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Keywords:     asm include optimize antix

Description:

  AStripI  optimizes  assembly language include files.  It makes
  them faster to assemble and greatly reduces their size.

Requirements:

  - Any Amiga with V37+ (tested on 68000 ECS V37 A2000)

Features:

  - It's FreeWare.
  - Programmed in 100% assembly language
  - Full sourcecode included.
